"检测到片段的分辨率、帧率或音频参数不同，无法安全无损拼接。继续后将以队列中最大分辨率为目标尺寸：较小视频等比例放大；比例不同则居中补边，不会拉伸画面。输出统一编码为 H.264 + AAC MP4。" = "The clips have different resolutions, frame rates, or audio settings, so they cannot be merged safely without re-encoding. Compatible Merge uses the largest source resolution: smaller clips scale up proportionally, different aspect ratios are padded in the centre, and nothing is stretched. Output is H.264 + AAC MP4.";
